# Files kept in the repo but NOT part of the Payment All Apps Script project.
#
# standalone/ holds the Grey Gmail collector, which runs in its own Apps Script
# project bound to each Grey mailbox. Pushing it here would put a second writer
# to the Transaction sheet inside the same project by accident.
standalone/**

# Sheet exports carry Client ID / Client Secret in the Account tab.
**/*.xlsx

# Tài liệu tham chiếu, đọc trong repo chứ không chạy trong Apps Script.
# .md vốn đã không nằm trong scriptExtensions, đây là lớp chặn thứ hai.
docs/**
**/*.md

.git/**
.gitignore
.claspignore
.DS_Store
